    "name":  "Surface Mount Kit for LED Panel 120x30 - H65mm",
    "reference":  "KIT8003",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSurface Kit for LED Panel 120x30\u003c/strong\u003e, made of high-quality aluminum with white finish, this kit allows installing \u003cstrong\u003e120x30\u003c/strong\u003e LED panels on non-removable ceilings easily and safely. Its \u003cstrong\u003e65mm height\u003c/strong\u003e design is perfect for back light type panels up to \u003cstrong\u003e64mm\u003c/strong\u003e, guaranteeing aesthetic and functional integration in any space. The ideal solution for practical and modern installation!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eSurface Kit for LED Panel 120x30 - H65mm\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSurface mounting kit to convert recessed LED panels 120x30 to surface mount. 65mm height. Aluminum body.\u003c/p\u003e",
